14. In the case of Pramod Suryabhan Pawar (supra) the accused was Deputy Commandant in CRPF,
while the victim was Assistant Commissioner of Sales Tax and Hon'ble Supreme Court found that allegations in the F.I.R. did not on the face of it indicate that the promise by the appellant was false,
or that the complainant engaged in sexual relations on the basis of this promise.
